  HandbookIntro: "Bu el kitab\u0131, yap\u0131 ruhsat\u0131 ba\u015Fvurular\u0131nda aranacak en d\xFC\u015F\xFCk de\u011Ferleri i\xE7erir.\n\n1. Ba\u015Fvurudaki adresten mahalleyi bul.\n2. Mahallenin deprem b\xF6lgesini tablodan \xF6\u011Fren.\n3. O b\xF6lgenin sayfas\u0131nda yap\u0131n\u0131n kat say\u0131s\u0131na uyan sat\u0131rdaki de\u011Ferlerle laboratuvar raporunu kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r.\n\nTek bir de\u011Fer bile yetersizse yap\u0131 onaylanamaz."
